<div style="font-family:'Segoe UI',Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;color:#222;">
  <div style="background:#c2410c;color:#fff;padding:24px;border-radius:8px 8px 0 0;text-align:center;">
    <h2 style="margin:0;">Verification request received</h2>
  </div>
  <div style="border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-top:0;padding:24px;border-radius:0 0 8px 8px;">
    <p>Hi <strong><%= @user.full_name %></strong>,</p>
    <p>
      You have successfully applied for the Preview Tax verification badge.
      <%= @payment[:amount].to_i.positive? ? "Your payment has been received." : "" %>
      Our team will review your documents shortly.
    </p>

    <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:14px;margin:16px 0;">
      <% [
        ["Amount paid", @payment[:amount].to_i.positive? ? "₹#{@payment[:amount]}" : "No fee"],
        ["Payment method", @payment[:method].to_s == "cashfree" ? "Online (Cashfree)" : (@payment[:method].to_s == "wallet" ? "Wallet" : "-")],
        ["Payment / order ID", @payment[:reference]],
        ["Paid at", @payment[:paid_at].present? ? (Time.zone.parse(@payment[:paid_at].to_s)&.strftime("%B %d, %Y at %I:%M %p %Z") rescue @payment[:paid_at]) : @submitted_at]
      ].each do |label, value| %>
        <tr>
          <td style="padding:8px 10px;background:#f9fafb;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;width:40%;"><strong><%= label %></strong></td>
          <td style="padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;"><%= value.presence || "-" %></td>
        </tr>
      <% end %>
    </table>

    <p>Once approved, your badge will be active for <strong><%= Account::VERIFICATION_CYCLE_DAYS %> days from the approval date</strong>. We will email you as soon as a decision is made.</p>
    <p>Questions? Write to <strong>support@previewtax.com</strong>.</p>
    <p>Regards,<br><strong>Preview Tax Team</strong></p>
  </div>
</div>
